{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a harrowing journey with Alice, a college student, and her classmate Adrian, as they venture to a desolate town in search of a special cave. Uncover the chilling mystery surrounding Alice's strange nightmares and their connection to the town. The horror awaits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong>: A deeply narrative-driven horror game. The story being the primary focus of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles</strong>: Intuitive puzzles designed to engage without frustrating. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music</strong>: A nostalgic soundtrack inspired by early 2000s gaming classics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo Developer</strong>: A solo developer's first game, with a few playtesters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHAPTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers 7 to 15 hours of gameplay, depending on reading speed and engagement with optional content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Warning: Chapters 1-3 include puzzles, Chapter 4 features quick-time events, and the final chapter leans more towards a visual novel style with some quick-time events. The reasons for this structure delve into spoiler territory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- There are a total of 5 chapters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Chapters 1-4 each provide around 1-2 hours of gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Chapter 5 offers a longer experience, lasting approximately 3 hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999910/extras/2b50e43919d33a746c2bb0bf035206b1.webp?t=1744244755\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999910/extras/2b50e43919d33a746c2bb0bf035206b1.poster.avif?t=1744244755\" class=\"bb_img\" width=484 height=196 /></picture></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Balanced","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2999910/25c1011128b5e400c7349ea9f47c6196245208d9.jpg"},{"name":"Constricted","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2999910/e492c56ab70ddb0364efb320cd13bf9ba2befd79.jpg"},{"name":"Spikes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2999910/635941096829c2c93ae61da7f78f72b3a83fd66f.jpg"},{"name":"Smooth Brain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2999910/4294c05225a347df2cb5aa359dc6c051dddeb527.jpg"},{"name":"Wrinkly Brain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2999910/a0f5893373d58ad974b01ce2357bacedecdb4234.jpg"},{"name":"The Journey Begins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2999910/f4b313c5d959087c5d179c50fa4e8516ea969740.jpg"},{"name":"Shiny Blue Eye!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2999910/115c7409fbbbaf183b7b4cae17a6c9c58a42876b.jpg"},{"name":"Cake :)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2999910/ecd9bb7b331f9dd75531a5d96fb936ae90ea877e.jpg"},{"name":"Pie :)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2999910/1922a4c22e39de03a64cfb7642eb1011ff7cd094.jpg"},{"name":"Pancakes :)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2999910/71f3e5e8d5b2ff0a6d4a7b9168e6727dc7fe1a47.jpg"}],"total":59},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2999910?t=1744244755","b